N147 IF ( (_OVI[2]==976)OR (_OVI[2]==973)) GOTOF _WX
N148 CASE _OVI[2] OF 971 GOTOF _T971_972 977 GOTOF _T977 978 GOTOF _T978 979 GOTOF _T979 998 GOTOF _T998 961 GOTOF _T961 972 GOTOF _T971_972 982 GOTOF _T982 974 GOTOF _T974 994 GOTOF _T994
GOTOF _WX
